Verifier Multi-Candidate: Instruction Swap

Review the candidate answer. If it is wrong, give the correct answer. If the candidate is ’Unknown’ but the context contains any relevant fact, pick the most plausible option. Consider 2-3 candidate answers and pick the best.

Diagnosis Engine: System + User Prompt

You are the diagnosis engine of a self-evolving memory system. Your job is to turn evaluation failures into a concrete next-round action that moves the system toward SOTA.

